{
  "key": 19954,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0967_CV_CANVAS_CELADON_HOTEL_CeladonCity_Hotel_Text_ThisHotelIsForPeople",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon?\n",
        "No, this is a hotel for people.\r",
        "We’re full up, unfortunately."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0967_CV_CANVAS_CELADON_HOTEL_CeladonCity_Hotel_Text_OnVacationWithBrotherAndBoyfriend",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m on vacation with my brother and\n",
        "boyfriend.\r",
        "Celadon is such a pretty city!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0967_CV_CANVAS_CELADON_HOTEL_CeladonCity_Hotel_Text_WhyDidSheBringBrother",
      "en_US": [
        "Why?\n",
        "Why did she bring her brother?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0967_CV_CANVAS_CELADON_HOTEL_CeladonCity_Hotel_Text_SisBroughtMeOnVacation",
      "en_US": [
        "Yippee! I’m on vacation!\n",
        "My sis brought me along! Awesome!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0967_CV_CANVAS_CELADON_HOTEL_TrainingHouse_Text_RosalindIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m staying in Celadon for the\n",
        "shopping, and the battles.\r",
        "Want to battle?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0967_CV_CANVAS_CELADON_HOTEL_TrainingHouse_Text_After",
      "en_US": [
        "Come back any time you want\n",
        "to battle again!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0967_CV_CANVAS_CELADON_HOTEL_TrainingHouse_Text_PercivalIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "The hotel lets me battle in the\n",
        "lobby. Splendid, isn’t it?\r",
        "Want to battle?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0967_CV_CANVAS_CELADON_HOTEL_PaintWorld_Text_FigureFirst",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "A figure made of paint turns to\n",
        "face you. It raises a brush."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0967_CV_CANVAS_CELADON_HOTEL_TrainingHouse_Text_Declined",
      "en_US": "Whenever you’re ready, then."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0967_CV_CANVAS_CELADON_HOTEL_PaintWorld_Text_FigureSketch",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "The figure’s colors swirl.\n",
        "It’s waiting for you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0967_CV_CANVAS_CELADON_HOTEL_PaintWorld_Text_FigureMega",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "The figure is holding a stone that\n",
        "shines in every color."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0967_CV_CANVAS_CELADON_HOTEL_PaintWorld_Text_Dissolve",
      "en_US": [
        "The figure runs like wet paint…\n",
        "The world around it does too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0967_CV_CANVAS_CELADON_HOTEL_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
